sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Operator as Operator
    actor Keeper as Warehouse Keeper

    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as ShipmentsController
    participant Service as ShipmentService
    participant Store as ShipmentStore
    participant PaymentStore as PaymentStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. ASSIGN DELIVERY PERSONNEL
    %% ==========================================

    Operator->>+UI: Select Shipment and assign Driver / Vehicle

    UI->>+API: Assign(shipmentId, request)
    API->>+Service: AssignAsync(shipmentId, data, actorRole)

    Service->>+Service: EnsureOperator(actorRole)
    Service-->>Service: Authorization result
    deactivate Service

    alt User is not authorized

        Note right of Service: Return Forbidden

    else Operator is authorized

        Service->>+Store: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT Shipment by Id
        DB-->>Store: Shipment or null
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Shipment result
        deactivate Store

        alt Shipment not found or not assignable

            Note right of Service: Return Not Found or Conflict

        else Shipment can be assigned

            %% ==========================================
            %% 2. VALIDATE DRIVER
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: FindDriverAsync(driverId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT Driver by Id
            DB-->>Store: Driver details or null
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Driver result
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 3. VALIDATE VEHICLE
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: FindVehicleAsync(vehicleId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT Vehicle by Id
            DB-->>Store: Vehicle details or null
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Vehicle result
            deactivate Store

            alt Invalid Driver / Vehicle or Warehouse mismatch

                Note right of Service: Reject invalid transport assignment

            else Driver and Vehicle are valid

                %% ==========================================
                %% 4. SAVE TRANSPORT ASSIGNMENT
                %% ==========================================

                Note right of Service: Set DriverId and VehicleId

                Note right of Service: Store Driver and Vehicle snapshots

                Service->>+Store: SaveChangesAsync()

                Store->>+DB: UPDATE Shipment assignment and snapshots
                DB-->>Store: Assignment saved
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Save successful
                deactivate Store

                Note right of Service: Assignment does not dispatch Shipment

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. RETURN ASSIGNMENT RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: ShipmentResult or business error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Assignment response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Operator: Display assignment status
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 6. CONFIRM WAREHOUSE ISSUE
    %% ==========================================

    Keeper->>+UI: Confirm warehouse issue for Shipment

    UI->>+API: ConfirmIssue(shipmentId, request)
    API->>+Service: ConfirmIssueAsync(shipmentId, data, actorContext)

    Note over Service,DB: ConfirmIssue uses ExecuteInTransactionAsync

    %% ==========================================
    %% 7. LOAD SHIPMENT AND ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    Service->>+Store: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

    Store->>+DB: SELECT Shipment and current status
    DB-->>Store: Shipment or null
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Shipment result
    deactivate Store

    alt Shipment not found or already processed incorrectly

        Note right of Service: Return existing result or business error

    else Shipment is eligible for issue checks

        Service->>+Store: FindOrderForUpdateAsync(orderId)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrder for transactional update
        DB-->>Store: Current SalesOrder
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: SalesOrder
        deactivate Store

        %% ==========================================
        %% 8. VALIDATE WAREHOUSE ACCESS
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: CanAccessWarehouseAsync(actorId, warehouseId)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT Warehouse access scope
        DB-->>Store: Access result
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Authorized or Forbidden
        deactivate Store

        alt Keeper cannot access Shipment Warehouse

            Note right of Service: Return Forbidden

        else Warehouse access is valid

            %% ==========================================
            %% 9. CHECK WHOLE-ORDER READINESS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: ListExpectedWarehousesAsync(orderId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT all expected Warehouse portions
            DB-->>Store: ExpectedWarehouseParts
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Expected Warehouse list
            deactivate Store

            Note over Service,DB: Every required Warehouse must complete Picking

            %% ==========================================
            %% 10. CHECK PAYMENT READINESS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+PaymentStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId)

            PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payment status for SalesOrder
            DB-->>PaymentStore: Payment information
            deactivate DB

            PaymentStore-->>Service: Payment result
            deactivate PaymentStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 11. LOAD ISSUABLE INVENTORY
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: ListIssuableAsync(shipmentId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT allocations, reservations and Batch stock
            DB-->>Store: ShipmentIssueRows
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Issuable inventory details
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 12. VALIDATE ISSUE CONDITIONS
            %% ==========================================

            alt Another Warehouse is still picking

                Note right of Service: Reject issue for the entire order

            else Open exception or stock eligibility conflict

                Note right of Service: Reject issue and require resolution

            else Payment or Credit condition is not satisfied

                Note right of Service: Do not issue stock

            else Shipment is ready for issue

                %% ==========================================
                %% 13. CONSUME RESERVED STOCK
                %% ==========================================

                Note over Service,Store: Validate current inventory before changing quantities

                loop For each issued Batch portion

                    Note right of Service: Decrease PhysicalQuantity

                    Note right of Service: Decrease ReservedQuantity

                    Note right of Service: Set Reservation to Consumed

                    Service->>+Store: AddInventoryTransaction(issueTransaction)

                    Store-->>Service: Stock movement staged
                    deactivate Store

                end

                %% ==========================================
                %% 14. UPDATE SHIPMENT ISSUE STATUS
                %% ==========================================

                Note right of Service: Set Shipment status to Issued

                Note right of Service: Record IssuedAt

                Note right of Service: Update order status when issue conditions are met

                Service->>+Store: AddOrderHistory(orderHistory)

                Store-->>Service: Order history staged
                deactivate Store

                %% ==========================================
                %% 15. COMMIT INVENTORY ISSUE
                %% ==========================================

                Service->>+Store: SaveChangesAsync()

                Store->>+DB: UPDATE InventoryBalance and Reservations

                Note right of DB: UPDATE Shipment and SalesOrder statuses

                Note right of DB: INSERT InventoryTransactions and OrderStatusHistory

                DB-->>Store: Transaction outcome
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Save result
                deactivate Store

                alt Issue transaction committed

                    Note right of Service: Physical and Reserved Stock decreased once

                else Concurrency or stock conflict

                    Note right of Service: Roll back issue changes

                    Note right of Service: Do not retain partial stock deductions

                end

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 16. RETURN ISSUE RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: ShipmentResult or issue error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: ConfirmIssue response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Keeper: Display issue status
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 17. DISPATCH ISSUED SHIPMENT
    %% ==========================================

    Operator->>+UI: Confirm Shipment Dispatch

    UI->>+API: Dispatch(shipmentId, request)
    API->>+Service: DispatchAsync(shipmentId, data, actorRole)

    Service->>+Service: EnsureOperator(actorRole)
    Service-->>Service: Authorization result
    deactivate Service

    alt User is not Operator

        Note right of Service: Return Forbidden

    else Operator is authorized

        %% ==========================================
        %% 18. LOAD SHIPMENT FOR DISPATCH
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT Shipment, status and transport assignment
        DB-->>Store: Shipment details
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Shipment result
        deactivate Store

        alt Shipment not issued or transport assignment missing

            Note right of Service: Return Conflict

        else Shipment is issued and assigned

            %% ==========================================
            %% 19. LOAD SHIPMENT QR LABELS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: ListLabelsAsync(shipmentId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT QR Labels linked to Shipment
            DB-->>Store: ShipmentLabelViews
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Shipment QR Labels
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 20. STAGE QR LABEL EVENTS
            %% ==========================================

            loop For each Shipment QR Label

                Note right of Service: Prepare transition to InTransit

                Service->>+Store: AddLabelEvent(qrLabelEvent)

                Store-->>Service: QR Label event staged
                deactivate Store

            end

            %% ==========================================
            %% 21. CHECK ORDER SHIPMENTS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: ListByOrderAsync(orderId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT Shipments belonging to SalesOrder
            DB-->>Store: Order Shipment list
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Shipment collection
            deactivate Store

            Service->>+Store: FindOrderForUpdateAsync(orderId)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrder for transactional update
            DB-->>Store: Current SalesOrder
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: SalesOrder
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 22. UPDATE DISPATCH STATUS
            %% ==========================================

            Note right of Service: Set Shipment status to Dispatched

            Note right of Service: Record DispatchedAt

            Note right of Service: Update order status when applicable

            Service->>+Store: AddOrderHistory(orderHistory)

            Store-->>Service: Order history staged
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 23. COMMIT SHIPMENT DISPATCH
            %% ==========================================

            Note over Service,DB: Dispatch uses ExecuteInTransactionAsync

            Service->>+Store: SaveChangesAsync()

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE Shipment and QR Label statuses

            Note right of DB: INSERT QrLabelEvents and OrderStatusHistory

            Note right of DB: No second Physical Stock deduction

            DB-->>Store: Dispatch transaction outcome
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Save result
            deactivate Store

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 24. RETURN DISPATCH RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: ShipmentResult or dispatch error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Dispatch response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Operator: Display Shipment dispatch status
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Service,DB: Assigning transport does not change inventory

    Note over Service,DB: No Shipment may be issued before whole-order Picking readiness

    Note over Service,DB: ConfirmIssue consumes stock and reservations exactly once

    Note over Service,DB: Dispatch must not deduct Physical Stock again

    Note over Service,DB: All status changes must respect concurrency and idempotency